
	SUBC BUILD STATUS


	=== Cross-Compilation Support (2025-12-22) ===

	As of version 2025-12-22, SubC supports cross-compilation from
	a single binary. Use -L to list targets and -T to select one.

	macOS/arm64 (Apple Silicon), clang 15.0, SubC 20251222
		bootstrap	passed (cc -I. -o scc0 ...)
		-L flag		works (lists 11 targets)
		-T flag		works (tested all targets)
		cross-compile	passed (generates correct asm for all targets)

	Tested cross-compilation targets:
		linux-386	generates correct i386 assembly
		linux-x86-64	generates correct x86-64 assembly
		freebsd-386	generates correct i386 assembly
		freebsd-x86-64	generates correct x86-64 assembly
		freebsd-armv6	generates correct ARMv6 assembly
		netbsd-386	generates correct i386 assembly
		netbsd-x86-64	generates correct x86-64 assembly
		openbsd-386	generates correct i386 assembly
		darwin-x86-64	generates correct x86-64 assembly
		windows-386	generates correct i386 assembly
		dos-8086	generates correct 8086/TASM assembly


